WEBVTT

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:18.980
lnspector Yamazaki.

00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:20.030
Yes.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:26.000
Huh? What's this?

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.090
We got the call at midnight.

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:32.010
The parking lot attendant discovered the body.

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:35.590
His identity?

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:39.430
Well, he had his driver's license on him.

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:44.730
Kanji Suzuki, birth date...

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:47.650
Born in 1972?

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:51.530
Sure doesn't look it.

00:00:54.110 --> 00:00:56.280
Anyway, send it in for an autopsy.

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:57.570
Yes sir.

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:01.870
Never seen anything like it.

00:01:21.890 --> 00:01:25.730
Huh? That's funny. Where did it go?

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:27.980
That's strange.

00:01:33.190 --> 00:01:36.110
Where are they?

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:37.700
What's wrong, dear?

00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:39.120
Well...

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:43.830
Have you seen my glasses anywhere?

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:45.370
I can't find them anywhere.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.050
How did they get there?

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:11.310
So, Tsutomu passed his admissions exams?

00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:15.650
The results are posted today.

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:19.740
We don't know yet, so please try to keep your mouth shut.

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:23.490
You're making me more ''nervous'' than I already am.

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:24.990
Ooh, English word.

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:36.800
''Tsutomu''

00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:46.350
Wake up! This is your day of reckoning!

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:55.320
Finally, the day that will determine your fate.

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:59.110
Your destiny is sealed, Tsutomu.

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:01.570
I know...

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:06.200
He's actually taking this seriously.

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:08.330
What a bore.

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:22.090
Tactless girl.

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:39.360
He's calling me.

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:49.660
Have you ever done this before?

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:53.790
No. I've participated in many medical experiments, but...

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:55.170
Is that right?

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:58.380
You must have had to suffer at times.

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:04.180
Yes, like getting a really high fever, or getting a bad rash.

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:05.340
That's terrible.

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:10.350
Well, not to worry. We maintain very high safety standards.

00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:17.980
Quite the set up.

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:19.900
Gomez?

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:24.240
If the ingredients solidify, then I can make pills.

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:28.450
Right now, I still have to administer directly into the blood.

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:33.330
Let me introduce you to Mr. Mori, the subject of my experiments.

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:51.180
We cannot fail this time.

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:54.480
Ms. Revi supports my research.

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:56.980
She does for now.

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:06.240
All right. Tell her I'll look into it right away.

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:30.930
Please stand back from the white line.

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:03.000
Hey! What's going on?!

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:06.050
Birdy!

00:06:06.470 --> 00:06:07.800
Are you awake now?

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:09.680
Don't just take over like that.

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:13.350
Did you hear me? Don't do that. Today's a very important day for me.

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:16.680
- What am I doing here?
- Ssshh! Someone is watching us.

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:19.230
- Who?
- Quiet!

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:20.980
Why?

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:47.050
Christella Revi!

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:15.200
Violeen.

00:07:33.590 --> 00:07:35.220
Birdy.

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:38.100
Birdy? What's up?

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:41.390
How about the bad guys?

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:48.610
Oh, no! I've got to get somewhere!

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:55.700
Admissions Exam Results

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:04.420
1439...

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:19.640
No! I can't look!

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:21.980
Too bad. You failed?

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:25.480
It's unfortunate, but think...

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:28.770
You need this when you're down.

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:31.110
Here.

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:33.780
Wow, do you always keep this with you?

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:36.410
It all depends on the time and place.

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:38.240
Hey, you guys!

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:41.370
Natsumi!

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:44.160
What's this about the time and place? Will you grow up!

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:48.460
This is the best way to feel better when you're down.

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:51.130
Huh? You mean you all failed?

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:54.760
The two of us certainly passed, but unfortunately...

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:55.800
...he didn't.

00:08:55.880 --> 00:08:57.680
Well, life's tough.

00:08:58.470 --> 00:09:00.350
You'll have your day, one day.

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:02.270
Bye...

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:04.690
Your number's not there?

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:08.690
Well, actually, I haven't really checked.

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:11.030
Oh. Well, then.

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:13.820
I'll go take a look for you. What's the number?

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:16.950
1439...

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:23.750
How humiliating!

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:34.090
It's all right. I'll get into some second rate school.

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:39.220
I didn't think I was going to pass anyway. No big deal.

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:44.430
Come on, look!

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:56.240
1...4...3...9...

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:03.290
I did it...! Yahoo...!

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:06.120
I did it, Birdy!

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:08.920
Stop yelling, will you?

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:11.710
Those people from before could still be around.

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:14.840
Sorry but, come on...

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:18.470
Yes, yes. Nice one, Tsutomu.

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:25.390
Who are you talking to? Are you feeling okay, Tsutomu?

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:28.480
It's nothing really.

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:30.100
Oh, no. What the...?

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:35.150
Wait-!

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:42.830
What are you doing, dummy?!

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:54.750
I'm sorry, I'm not well. You know, the exam and all.

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:01.930
She hates me...

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:04.640
You're hopeless.

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:07.810
That hurt.

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:25.330
What do you mean?

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:30.370
You can't just control my body like that. I can't allow that.

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:36.340
Lighten up. I was just playing around. No harm done.

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:38.130
I'm talking about this morning.

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:42.630
How come I had to go to lkebukuro this morning?

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:44.470
You and your alien games.

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:46.050
What do you mean?

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:52.020
This is about aliens. Nothing to do with humans. So count me out!

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:55.860
Look, I don't know much of what this is about, and I don't want to know...

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:58.900
...but aren't you just looking for revenge?

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:01.490
No, that's, that's not true.

00:12:02.740 --> 00:12:06.490
I've had enough of you. Just go away!

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:09.410
Leave my body, and leave earth!

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:41.360
Does it hurt? Are you suffering?

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:44.910
But just think, you are becoming an ever more superior being.

00:12:58.040 --> 00:13:01.300
He has high expectations for his test subject.

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:04.380
We cannot afford any mistakes.

00:13:04.420 --> 00:13:06.470
Hikawa is moving too fast with this.

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:10.850
It's premature to say that the ingredients of the serum are ready.

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:13.890
These experiments will help then.

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:16.310
We now have the perfect subject.

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:18.610
The girl we saw this morning ID'ed just right.

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:20.860
She's very hard to catch.

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:25.990
She was more than Bachilus and Geega could handle, apparently.

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:28.490
That was a result of their carelessness.

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:32.490
You can't deny that the solution is perfectly clear.

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:36.330
We must get a better subject, and rid ourselves of a Federation Officer.

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:40.090
It's an opportunity to kill two birds with one stone, don't you think?

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:42.000
Certainly.

00:13:43.630 --> 00:13:46.510
Then I'll leave it up to you.

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:55.100
It seems that he was some sort of drug addict.

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:57.480
That's what I suspected.

00:13:57.560 --> 00:14:01.360
But I've never seen a victim looking like that.

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:03.650
There were no external wounds, but what I can say is that...

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:07.490
...there was abnormality in his thyroidal hormones.

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:09.360
But, there is one more thing...

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:09.870
What is it?

00:14:10.570 --> 00:14:12.990
The brain seems to have shriveled.

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:16.160
This is a normal human brain.

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:19.000
And here's the victim's brain.

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:22.290
You can see that the cerebrum has shrunk by two-thirds.

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:24.590
Also, you can see that the cerebellum is enlarged.

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:27.840
An R-reptilian complex.

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:29.470
R what?

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:32.600
It's proof that humans are mere animals.

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:35.100
It's the region that's also...

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:37.890
Why would there be such a thing in a human brain?

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:40.730
It's the region most responsible for the attack instinct,

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:42.560
and very useful for totalitarian control.

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:46.740
There has even been research using drugs to enlarge the brain.

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:49.150
Research? What for?

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:51.450
To design fierce and obedient soldiers.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:56.120
The military did all sorts of human experiments during the war.

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:59.790
Do you know where we can find material on those experiments?

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:03.670
Well, those documents were supposedly destroyed after the war, but...

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:06.420
there are some who say they were confiscated by the Americans.

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:10.130
We'll have to find people who were involved in this.

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:13.510
We're talking 50 years ago. How are we going to do that?

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:17.180
You've got good strong legs.

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:20.640
A little leg-work shouldn't be a problem.

00:15:22.850 --> 00:15:24.400
I understand.

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:31.240
Tsutomu! Dinner's ready!

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:33.490
I'm sorry for calling so late.

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:37.660
I'm Senkawa, and I'd like to speak to Ms. Natsumi.

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:39.370
Tsutomu!

00:15:55.970 --> 00:15:57.220
Good evening!

00:15:57.310 --> 00:16:01.850
My name is Senkawa, and I was with your daughter in junior high.

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:03.230
Is Natsumi...?

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:04.100
Tsutomu?

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:07.400
Oh, Natsumi! I'm really sorry about this morning.

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:11.030
I was ill. Don't take it the wrong way.

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:15.950
You still mad at me?

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:19.910
Don't worry about it. Oh!

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:20.870
What's wrong?

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:24.790
Natsumi? Hello, Natsumi?

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:26.170
Oh, sorry.

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:27.920
What's wrong?

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:31.800
Well, actually, do you think you can come here right away?

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:36.850
My family is away, and I'm here all by myself.

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:40.890
And there's a strange man hanging around outside my window!

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:43.100
I'm scared!

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:47.190
So how did Tsutomu do?

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:51.400
Tsutomu?!

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:54.860
I guess that says it all.

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:55.660
Really Dear!

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:59.490
You know dear, at times likes these, sometimes it's best to leave them alone.

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:00.620
But...but..

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:03.710
Whoa! Look at this. What an amazing spread!

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:07.040
Hazumi, are you a big girl today?

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:11.460
How old do you think I am, dad?

00:17:11.510 --> 00:17:14.380
I see. Then what's the occasion?

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:17.930
It's to celebrate Tsutomu passing his exam. What else?

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:21.890
Really?!

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:38.410
Who is that?

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:18.150
What does he want? Maybe I should call the police.

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:28.120
An Arkazoid!

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:31.000
Damn! What's he doing here?

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:39.430
Tsutomu!

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:41.180
Natsumi. Are you all right?

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:43.470
See him? The creepy man.

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:46.850
Don't leave your apartment. You stay inside!

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:49.060
Tsutomu!

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:06.410
Tsutomu!

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:15.550
Let's switch.

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:16.840
We can't! Natsumi's watching!

00:19:17.300 --> 00:19:18.840
Don't worry about that now!

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:25.810
If you die, I die as well.

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:27.390
No, idiot!

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:45.740
What are you going to do now?!

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:55.380
Don't you try to escape!

00:19:57.170 --> 00:19:59.670
Hey! What about Natsumi?

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:01.930
That's not our biggest problem right now!

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:36.460
What's going on?!

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:43.340
Hey, everyone can see us!

00:20:43.430 --> 00:20:46.220
I can't help it. I've got to chase him.

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:15.870
What...? This is...!

00:21:20.210 --> 00:21:21.050
Birdy!

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:23.380
You're on the ball.

00:22:14.470 --> 00:22:16.140
- What is all this?
- Dunno.

00:22:19.440 --> 00:22:21.310
All right. Begin.

00:22:52.350 --> 00:22:55.270
Birdy, we're going to drown!

00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:22.630
I see you have psy power. You must come from a lowly planet.

00:23:23.040 --> 00:23:25.250
Fitting that you'd work for Revi.

00:23:49.740 --> 00:23:53.030
What's the matter? Doesn't he feel pain?

00:24:31.820 --> 00:24:33.240
What's with this guy?

00:24:33.280 --> 00:24:35.110
He has the smell of a human like Tsutomu.

00:24:35.200 --> 00:24:39.910
Don't be stupid. How could he possibly be human?!

00:25:09.770 --> 00:25:10.780
Help me.

00:25:10.860 --> 00:25:15.030
What has happened to my body?

00:25:38.510 --> 00:25:41.350
So he was human, after all.

00:25:42.270 --> 00:25:44.230
What's this about? Explain yourself!

00:25:45.270 --> 00:25:47.900
Just a little experiment I was trying out.

00:25:47.980 --> 00:25:50.730
Though I'll apparently have to work on it some more.

00:25:51.440 --> 00:25:53.360
You're a human being, aren't you?

00:25:53.360 --> 00:25:55.570
What are you trying to accomplish by treating people like that?

00:25:57.660 --> 00:25:58.660
What, indeed.

00:26:05.660 --> 00:26:06.750
It's you!

00:26:08.880 --> 00:26:11.090
I have this to say to you.

00:26:11.170 --> 00:26:14.010
Revi cannot be stopped by a Federation Officer.

00:26:14.840 --> 00:26:16.920
Stay away from Christella Revi.

00:26:17.010 --> 00:26:18.380
Try and stop me.

00:26:26.480 --> 00:26:28.810
Next time it won't be just your arm.

00:26:28.900 --> 00:26:30.230
Think about it.

00:26:35.360 --> 00:26:38.030
Birdy! Are you all right?

00:26:38.030 --> 00:26:41.700
Tsutomu, could you please take me to the shuttle?

00:26:46.120 --> 00:26:47.910
Even the earth...

00:26:48.920 --> 00:26:52.090
is now entangled...

00:26:53.500 --> 00:26:56.630
in this alien confusion.

00:27:25.790 --> 00:27:28.080
All right. It's better now.

00:27:28.120 --> 00:27:31.710
Next time I run into him, I'll tear him to pieces.

00:27:31.790 --> 00:27:32.880
Right.

00:27:33.580 --> 00:27:35.550
Does that mean you're going to help me?

00:27:35.630 --> 00:27:38.260
Isn't that the only way?

00:27:38.800 --> 00:27:40.380
You know I appreciate it.

00:27:40.470 --> 00:27:41.970
But, could we...

00:27:42.050 --> 00:27:42.590
What is it?

00:27:42.680 --> 00:27:45.010
Could we be more careful?

00:27:45.100 --> 00:27:46.930
We only really have one body.

00:27:47.010 --> 00:27:48.220
That's right.

00:27:48.890 --> 00:27:53.150
I guess it doesn't look good to switch like that in front of Natsumi.

00:27:54.690 --> 00:27:58.690
Oh, no! That's right! What am I going to do?

00:27:58.780 --> 00:28:00.320
Yeah, that.

00:28:01.450 --> 00:28:02.820
It'll all work out.

00:28:02.910 --> 00:28:05.700
I really hope so, Birdy!

00:28:13.040 --> 00:28:16.330
Suddenly we meet by accident

00:28:19.250 --> 00:28:23.710
My heart is susceptible to getting caught

00:28:26.090 --> 00:28:31.510
Whether it be by road or jet, I will dash out

00:28:31.510 --> 00:28:36.480
Hey go go, Okay go go girl

00:28:38.100 --> 00:28:41.730
I absolutely will not let go

00:28:44.610 --> 00:28:48.780
I will take you by force

00:28:51.450 --> 00:28:57.200
running to the amusement park

00:28:57.460 --> 00:29:00.460
Follow me

00:29:02.790 --> 00:29:06.840
That's right, <i>Future Shock</i>, to you...

00:29:06.840 --> 00:29:10.050
<i>Future Shock</i>, dashing around

00:29:10.050 --> 00:29:16.220
<i>Future Shock</i>, don't say that you don't understand me

00:29:16.220 --> 00:29:19.390
I want you to stay with me

00:29:19.520 --> 00:29:24.480
Let's find the same thrill
